{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026H8TU3dVZG41795341398.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>男子網球年終賽，「一哥」施華利夫晉級決賽。</p><p></p><p>黑衫的施華利夫，與美維迪夫首盤互保發球局，不過到決勝局就一面倒佔優，以「細分」7-0先贏一盤。</p><p></p><p>世界第五的美維迪夫，開出12次「ACE」，但「一發」得分率不夠七成。施華利夫就有八成一，亦開出16次「ACE」，第二盤第七局，造出全場唯一一次破發，這位29歲德國球手，贏多盤6-4，用了約1個半小時，以盤數2-0打入決賽。</p><p></p><p>對手將會是藍衫的艾卡拉斯，他以盤數2-1反勝舒爾頓，將爭取首奪這項錦標。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:43:44.641965+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:08:50.343181+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:12.885344+00:00","content_hash":"9cd5ce951ba250fcb2ceaccbc6f575f0b9b38d5bf08ad0da44eb8cbfbfeb68c5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:43:44.641965+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}